e. Public and authenticated staff access work on TCP 8080, failed authentication protects staff content, listings and credential files are inaccessible, the supplied tree is intact, and the original RHEL release and kernel were retained. Restart and recovery evidence is complete and independently corroborated.","limitations":["The retained Apache configuration backup was not shown to be required or cleaned up; this is a minor hygiene issue rather than a functional defect."]}
